 /><zone xml:id="m-eaefb0ae-0f24-4a33-af9c-95b4075d649d" ulx="65" uly="856" lrx="824" lry="900" /><zone xml:id="m-a533f975-58dc-4da2-86d7-a9bd0b473369" ulx="435" uly="902" lrx="547" lry="938" /><zone xml:id="m-b4f93974-7bf3-4bb0-bf5e-dc77124d496a" ulx="89" uly="932" lrx="938" lry="981" /><zone xml:id="m-b2469453-2293-4755-a2a8-d0a17bfdf545" ulx="44" uly="964" lrx="936" lry="1011" /><zone xml:id="m-e96ea396-d466-4f1f-9b37-b2ed3f7b1b80" ulx="43" uly="993" lrx="634" lry="1035" /><zone xml:id="m-03596279-f55d-4b30-9f9e-d3ac0e8bbe33" ulx="438" uly="1042" lrx="543" lry="1075" /><zone xml:id="m-615082b4-afc5-4187-adbe-5210e97a763a" ulx="81" uly="1072" lrx="937" lry="1114" /><zone xml:id="m-347f1d6c-ff2e-472c-ae1e-02cbeb314008" ulx="47" uly="1101" lrx="936" lry="1148" /><zone xml:id="m-af0d0341-1023-40f9-8981-a897ac87c60e" ulx="46" uly="1130" lrx="637" lry="1177" /><zone xml:id="m-0a55f5bc-6b0d-4db3-bf10-17e25c6cbe1b" ulx="369" uly="1177" lrx="616" lry="1213" /><zone xml:id="m-5900664e-4466-4935-8437-3a765d2c7e5b" ulx="88" uly="1205" lrx="935" lry="1250" /><zone xml:id="m-16309d8b-f524-4c6c-ae60-5ffba8621c24" ulx="45" uly="1236" lrx="935" lry="1275" /><zone xml:id="m-a3aaf6d3-770e-4924-8d36-d6883cee3626" ulx="41" uly="1264" lrx="932" lry="1308" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-a06e5276-b6c5-4a37-9a65-e720aad69ce5" n="1667" facs="#m-0eed4915-5b45-4c55-895b-b6380735076c" /><div xml:id="m-fe8ded09-6cc4-452e-8d44-30600ef0575a">
            <lg xml:id="m-2bd9871a-21c4-40c9-8810-8af8638976b6">
              <l xml:id="m-552f7968-65d3-49dc-9935-974718150b26" facs="#m-6f82f853-d8db-491d-96ea-d9be50f6574c" label="ambiguous">1405</l><l xml:id="m-d85f1000-54b2-4b57-9053-e78f1cf8487a" facs="#m-b9b0e859-5d83-4e77-87cb-9b1979b1d356" label="ambiguous">May 9. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-da2fe45a-2383-4661-972b-cb6db8791f8d" facs="#m-f2c6c047-5b30-4b90-990a-e0b38a1d89d7" label="ambiguous">St. Gregory Nazianzen,</l><l xml:id="m-a054ed1d-22ce-4b7d-be39-1ddd14ffe984" facs="#m-9d30f036-99b2-4a1d-b5c4-d6b8f7678568" label="ambiguous">9.</l><l xml:id="m-9874dbf7-0fa9-4247-8e6c-b2da84232e0d" facs="#m-a32c6664-9aff-488d-8338-1d8f4b26febe" label="text-like">Bishop, Confessor, and Doctor of the Church. Double.</l><l xml:id="m-f39e867d-2e0a-4d54-9f51-aea5e8530495" facs="#m-7a43efdf-c868-4ead-92a5-06aef58e2dfb" label="lyrics-like">At Vespers, at Magn. Ant. O Dóctor... beâte Gregóri. p. 262s.</l><l xml:id="m-05cc7fa9-64fe-4c17-b617-f1da79a6bbf0" facs="#m-946abda2-2154-4989-a39f-95cc1328e406" label="lyrics-like">Mass. In médio. p. 1190.</l><l xml:id="m-4634fb10-c9fe-4955-989e-febb9863d9c6" facs="#m-74c103d8-7cf1-4a9f-b626-07cf083c3830" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-1e9383a9-353a-47a6-b9f2-bbc28d276acc" facs="#m-345249dc-3dd1-4c3d-b3c1-c616337882d3" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui pópulo tuo aetérnae, habúimus in terris, * intercessórem</l><l xml:id="m-203a4843-290b-479e-8eea-6b44a54f9d06" facs="#m-4f7abfdb-05dd-49c6-b072-55263d60db06" label="lyrics-like">U salútis beátum Gregórium mi-lhabére mereámur in caelis. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-f19d65ee-1969-4bc0-956f-1c811ebe10e4" facs="#m-979ccda9-00f0-4d3a-aeaa-19e2d49cd46b" label="lyrics-like">nistrum tribuisti : t praesta, quaé-l minum.</l><l xml:id="m-d92d6224-0d08-4b2e-83bf-76a9828ed35e" facs="#m-f8bb4fb9-fe74-4113-b43c-144087ab53c0" label="lyrics-like">sumus; ut, quem Doctórem vitae!</l><l xml:id="m-ea92ff2d-ea6d-498c-8152-4968aa8e9cbd" facs="#m-29220c8e-d9fd-4ba8-bd77-b0c3ea886579" label="text-like">Epistie. Justus cor suum. D. 1611. The Credo is said.</l><l xml:id="m-043106ad-23dc-4eca-9384-e19757dbbb62" facs="#m-0484ec6e-3126-472d-a513-a25eb160e0d7" label="text-like">St. Antoninus, Bishop and Confessor. Double.</l><l xml:id="m-d3cdff2b-b80a-441b-9b5a-72e6a64bb2bd" facs="#m-b2805fb4-af62-4b60-9920-6c9001479005" label="ambiguous">10.</l><l xml:id="m-616e15a4-8be9-4d59-bb15-819da9336eee" facs="#m-54acae85-7f5c-49f2-a111-0eb26938ac5a" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Státuit. of a Confessor Bishop, p. 1182, except the Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-46a97929-52c5-4cfd-8a38-744f093c2e22" facs="#m-8096b72d-bbe4-4e07-aae8-5fd77c9428e3" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-67567cfa-9135-4f9e-8a04-0c65db257ce6" facs="#m-8f475c6a-e89f-4ee1-90cb-8dffc8023416" label="lyrics-like">(Ancti Antoníni, Dómine, Con¬illo mirábilem praedicámus, ita in</l><l xml:id="m-59b7743f-166e-46a0-9254-41be471f46be" facs="#m-6772bb6e-2f70-482c-8c6a-d95bf064ce33" label="lyrics-like">O fessóris tui atque Pontificis mé¬ nos misericórdem fuisse gloriémur.</l><l xml:id="m-bdb8a6b9-41e5-4cb4-adab-3988bad0640c" facs="#m-dc729ce2-b557-4612-8751-7e3309de9b75" label="lyrics-like">ritis adjuvémur : t ut, sicut te inl Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-372a07cb-9366-4f0d-9a54-0ec917dab63b" facs="#m-eaefb0ae-0f24-4a33-af9c-95b4075d649d" label="text-like">Commemoration of SS. Gordian and Epimachus, Martyrs.</l><l xml:id="m-08509733-ed36-4fa4-8581-3141eab2bc5c" facs="#m-a533f975-58dc-4da2-86d7-a9bd0b473369" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-81e3c9a2-ad45-4d9b-9018-9ccd6f754536" facs="#m-b4f93974-7bf3-4bb0-bf5e-dc77124d496a" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus, omnípotens ¡chi solémnia cólimus, eórum apud</l><l xml:id="m-1f1279a6-afc1-4244-b1f1-e52382a37302" facs="#m-b2469453-2293-4755-a2a8-d0a17bfdf545" label="lyrics-like">U Deus:*ut, qui beatórum Mar-lte intercessiónibus adjuvémur. Per</l><l xml:id="m-2518598a-46b3-4290-bad4-3ea4f0eca331" facs="#m-e96ea396-d466-4f1f-9b37-b2ed3f7b1b80" label="lyrics-like">tyrum tuórum Gordiáni et Epima-l Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-bf0005a2-f834-4a1d-b531-dda74db448be" facs="#m-03596279-f55d-4b30-9f9e-d3ac0e8bbe33" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-f91c3a75-c836-4eaa-b37d-464ffcc6b978" facs="#m-615082b4-afc5-4187-adbe-5210e97a763a" label="lyrics-like">Ostias tibi, Dómine, beatórum (assúme: et ad perpétuum nobis</l><l xml:id="m-879b796b-82eb-4608-bbb8-1c33e23464f2" facs="#m-347f1d6c-ff2e-472c-ae1e-02cbeb314008" label="lyrics-like">R Mártyrum tuórum Gordiani et tribue provenire subsidium. Per</l><l xml:id="m-c69d0464-ae2e-459b-a8e5-1764a2513c8d" facs="#m-af0d0341-1023-40f9-8981-a897ac87c60e" label="lyrics-like">Epimachi dicátas méritis, benígnus! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9be76f70-913f-4894-aab9-69313143f197" facs="#m-0a55f5bc-6b0d-4db3-bf10-17e25c6cbe1b" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-57d7f5b2-32df-4fc9-95de-48ed4a4809c4" facs="#m-5900664e-4466-4935-8437-3a765d2c7e5b" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, omnípotens Deus :l tyribus tuis Gordiáno et Epímacho,</l><l xml:id="m-4e4b1e52-1f73-4990-9f5c-ff7225e85aff" facs="#m-16309d8b-f524-4c6c-ae60-5ffba8621c24" label="lyrics-like">Uut, qui caeléstia aliménta percé-I per haec contra ómnia advérsa</l><l xml:id="m-398b76d6-6896-4bc5-8010-3ae223ff7cf2" facs="#m-a3aaf6d3-770e-4924-8d36-d6883cee3626" label="lyrics-like">pimus, intercedéntibus sanctis Mar-l muniámur. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>